      Probability: 1
  - Name: Small Violet Clump
    Description: "A dark, warm, and soft mass to the touch. The world\u2019s current
      condition causes these clusters to form, something that could never occur under
      normal circumstances."
    ShortDescription: A dark, warm, and soft mass to the touch.
    GamePlayDescription: You gain 100 points.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
