      Value: 100
      Duration: 0
      Type: 1
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Violet Clump
    Description: A dark clump, about the size of an apple. The heat it gives off
      never fades, as if a small, unending star were burning at its core.
    ShortDescription: A dark clump, about the size of an apple.
    GamePlayDescription: You gain 200 points.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 2
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 500
      Duration: 0
      Type: 1
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Big Violet Clump
    Description: "A large, dark, warm mass, streaked with faint violet hues. When
      the planet\u2019s power is disturbed by external forces, primordial energy
      falls into chaos and gives rise to unnatural phenomena. This is one such manifestation."
    ShortDescription: A large, dark, warm mass, streaked with faint violet hues.
    GamePlayDescription: You gain 500 points.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 3
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 1000
      Duration: 0
      Type: 1
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Giant Violet Clump
    Description: A massive clump of dark matter, guardian of the mysteries surrounding
      the birth of the universe. Within it lies primordial energy, the original building
      block of the cosmos, holding every fragment of knowledge. Its destruction would
      mean the end of everything.
    ShortDescription: A massive clump of dark matter.
    GamePlayDescription: You gain 1000 points.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64447ebdddcff433ba23caf2cd95cff5, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 4
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 1000
      Duration: 0
      Type: 1
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Popju balm
    Description: A fragrant substance that emits a faint ochre-yellow glow. It is
      released by the Popju Bear during hibernation and was once gathered as a precious
      balm. Members of the Support Group applied it to their skin to increase their
      resilience during surface hunts.
    ShortDescription: A fragrant substance that emits a faint ochre-yellow glow.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain +1 DIF until death.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55cd5950a0ca0491fb08b691edfa4cb1, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55cd5950a0ca0491fb08b691edfa4cb1, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 5
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 1
      Duration: 0
      Type: 17
      UntilDeath: 1
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Battery
    Description: A pill made of potent chemical compounds that keeps the mind sharp
      even after long hours of exhausting work. It should be considered a drug, but
      those in power made it legal to push clay miners beyond their limits.
    ShortDescription: A pill made of potent chemical compounds that keeps the mind
      sharp.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain +3 FOC
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d9c90374e03e4e20aa68ed5ba3ffbcc, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d9c90374e03e4e20aa68ed5ba3ffbcc, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 6
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 3
      Duration: 0
      Type: 18
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Friend's Postcard
    Description: "A hand-drawn postcard depicting a large smiling 'moon' surrounded
      by slender tentacles. Though the image evokes fear and unease, it conveys an
      unexpected sense of calm, warmth, and sincerity \u2014 everything a true friend
      should offer."
    ShortDescription: A hand-drawn postcard depicting a large smiling 'moon' surrounded
      by slender tentacles.
    GamePlayDescription: Teleport to the last rest statute, without loosing life.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d2f208e4a8904c57b3b167fcd9538ef, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d2f208e4a8904c57b3b167fcd9538ef, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions:
    - ShopName: Strange Photo
      Description: A hand-drawn postcard depicting a large smiling moon surrounded
        by slender tentacles.
    Id: 7
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 0
      Duration: 0
      Type: 19
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Canned Food
    Description: "A dish made from a highly questionable mix of extremely high-calorie
      ingredients, all proudly compressed into a single container. It lasts for years\u2026
      but it\u2019s best consumed in moderation and preferably with a bathroom nearby."
    ShortDescription: A dish made from a highly questionable mix of extremely high-calorie
      ingredients.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain 2 HP.
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f052cd207cdf4316825a5aeb1fb99f6, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f052cd207cdf4316825a5aeb1fb99f6, type: 3}
