    Id: 8
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 2
      Duration: 0
      Type: 0
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: PSI Wave Generator
    Description: A mechanism capable of producing the elusive psi waves. According
      to the theory, they represent the energy that matter accumulates over time.
      Manifesting them can cause a slight distortion of reality, even if only for
      a brief moment.
    ShortDescription: A mechanism capable of producing the elusive psi waves.
    GamePlayDescription: Cause a slight distortion of reality
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1e7dadff5c9a47c89a4c9d27e28be66, type: 3}
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1e7dadff5c9a47c89a4c9d27e28be66, type: 3}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 9
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 0
      Duration: 5
      Type: 20
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Magic Formula
    Description: A small electronic device with a slip of paper covered in incomprehensible
      codes attached to its side. Many variants exist, both of the device and of
      the notes themselves; when activated, it emits a series of strange sounds.
      The Chief has never received any clear signal, but some of his disciples claim
      they dreamed of immense dragons on the night it was used.
    ShortDescription: A small electronic device with a slip of paper covered in incomprehensible
      codes attached to its side.
    GamePlayDescription: Save Game
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 0}
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 10
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
      Value: 0
      Duration: 5
      Type: 21
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Welcome Cocktail
    Description: "A dense brownish liquid that gives off a sharp, nauseating stench.
      Conceived by the members of the sect as an offering to welcome the invasion.
      Togheter with their devotion to the Dragons, they hope for the preservation
      of their Lives. Though its ingredients are unknown, one can imagine how it
      was made\u2026"
    ShortDescription: A dense brownish liquid that gives off a sharp, nauseating
      stench.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain 2 HP
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 0}
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    ShopDescriptions: []
    Id: 11
    Effects:
    - ValueType: 0
