      Duration: 0
      Type: 0
      UntilDeath: 0
      Probability: 1
  - Name: Crustacean Soup
    Description: A hearty stew made from the shells and remains of dead crustaceans
      gathered along the riverbank. As sacred creatures, they may only be eaten after
      death. Sadly, the polluted waters of these lands claim many of them long before
      their time.
    ShortDescription: A hearty stew made from the shells and remains of dead crustaceans
      gathered along the riverbank.
    GamePlayDescription: Gain 2 HP
